msgid ""
"Once `pyvista-wasm` has been installed, a [console script](https://setuptools."
"pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/entry_point.html) will be available with several "
"convenience commands to assist with browser-based 3-D visualization."
msgstr ""
"`pyvista-wasm`をインストールすると、ブラウザベースの3D可視化を支援するいくつか"
"の便利なコマンドを持つ[コンソールスクリプト](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/"
"userguide/entry_point.html)が利用可能になります。"

